<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Salomon starts four.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Salomon starts four.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers said analysts Marie Conway and Jim Sfiroudis initiated coverage of four stocks.</p>
<p>-- The analysts put strong buy ratings on ThermoTrex Corp, Kensey Nash Corp and Thermolase Corp.</p>
<p>-- They rated Beckman Instruments Inc a buy.</p>
</text>
